        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0000090</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Nephronophthisis is here regarded as a phenotypic feature. The disease of the same name results in progressive symmetrical destruction of the kidneys involving both the tubules and glomeruli.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Nephronophthisis</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
