        <owl:annotatedTarget>Height of the vermilion of the upper lip in the midline more than 2 SD below the mean. Alternatively, an apparently reduced height of the vermilion of the upper lip in the frontal view (subjective).</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:19125428</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
