        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased transverse dimension of face</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased width of face</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Horizontal deficiency of face</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
