        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0009553"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Distance between the hairline (trichion) and the glabella (the most prominent point on the frontal bone above the root of the nose), in the midline, more than two SD below the mean. Alternatively, an apparently decreased distance between the hairline and the glabella.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UMLS:C1842366</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Low frontal hairline</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
