        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Broad upturned nose</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0000455</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Nasal tip width is assessed at the anterior junction of the alae and the tip. This is easier in persons with a somewhat squared shape of the nasal tip. This may be best viewed from the inferior aspect of the nose. No objective measures are available. See Bulbous nose for a related term.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Broad nasal tip</rdfs:label>
