        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001120"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An enlargement of the cornea with normal clarity and function. Megalocornea is diagnosed with a horizontal corneal diameter of 12 mm or more at birth or 13 mm or more after two years of age.</obo:IAO_0000115>
