        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any abnormality of the electrical responses of various cell types in the retina as measured by electroretinography.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>HP:0003285</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SNOMEDCT_US:274524001</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
