        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000517"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A cataract is an opacity or clouding that develops in the crystalline lens of the eye or in its capsule.</obo:IAO_0000115>
