        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/hp#hposlim_core"/>
        <rdfs:comment>In general, congenital cataracts are bilateral and that is the assumption with the terms in this cataract subhierarchy.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Developmental cataract</rdfs:label>
