        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Neurological abnormality</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0000707</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>The nervous system comprises the neuraxis (brain, spinal cord, and ventricles), the autonomic nervous system, the enteric nervous system, and the peripheral nervous system.</rdfs:comment>
