        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Autistic behaviors</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>Autistic behaviours</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0000729</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>This term can be used to refer to autism spectrum disorder as a phenotypic feature that can be a component of a disease. Autism spectrum disorder range from a severe form, called autistic disorder, to a milder form, Asperger syndrome. If possible, we recommend annotating using more specific terms.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Autistic behavior</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
