        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Deficiency of speech development</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Delayed language development</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Delayed speech</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Delayed speech acquisition</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
