        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Impaired speech development</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Language delay</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Language delayed</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Language development deficit</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
