        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Oedema</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Water retention</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0000969</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Edema may be related to one or more of the following factors: 1) increased capillary hydrostatic pressure, 2) decreased osmotic pressure of plasma, 3) decreased tissue tension and lymphatic drainage, 4) increased osmotic pressure of tissue fluids, and 5) increased capillary permeability.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Edema</rdfs:label>
