        <obo:IAO_0000115>Asymmetric head shape, which is usually a combination of unilateral occipital flattening with ipsilateral frontal prominence, leading to rhomboid cranial shape.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>HP:0001121</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>Asymmetry of the posterior cranium</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
