        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0001601</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Laryngomalacia may affect the epiglottis, the arytenoid cartilages, or both. It is the most common cause of congenital stridor.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Laryngomalacia</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
