        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UMLS:C1854345</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Inability to move vocal cords</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Laryngeal paralysis</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0001605</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Vocal cord paralysis may lead to signs and symptoms such as hoarseness, inability to speak loudly, choking or coughing while eating with the risk of aspiration pneumonia. Affected patients may also experience breathing difficulties.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Vocal cord paralysis</rdfs:label>
