        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001871"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An abnormal susceptibility to bleeding, often referred to as a bleeding diathesis. A bleeding diathesis may be related to vascular, platelet and coagulation defects.</obo:IAO_0000115>
