        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Mental retardation, profound</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Profound mental retardation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0002187</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Persons with profound mental retardation generally require constant care.</rdfs:comment>
