        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Delay in central nervous system myelination</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0002188</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>A delay in the process of myelination, which normally begins in the fifth fetal month and is about 90 percent complete at the age of two years. Myelination continues into early adulthood.</rdfs:comment>
