        <obo:IAO_0000115>An abnormality resulting from a lack of intestinal ganglion cells (i.e., an aganglionic section of bowel) that results in bowel obstruction with enlargement of the colon.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>HP:0002029</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>HP:0002030</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
