        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000932"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Increase in size of the cisterna magna, one of three principal openings in the subarachnoid space between the arachnoid and pia mater, located between the cerebellum and the dorsal surface of the medulla oblongata.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UMLS:C1853377</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
