        <obo:IAO_0000115>The concentration of pyruvate in the blood circulation is above the upper limit of normal.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>UMLS:C1849488</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Increased serum pyruvate</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
