        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001167"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hand in which the fingers are of nearly equal length and deflected at the first interphalangeal joint, so as to give a forklike shape consisting of separation of the first and second as well as the third and fourth digits.</obo:IAO_0000115>
