        <obo:IAO_0000115>An abnormal narrowing or constriction of the pulmonary artery, in the main pulmonary artery and/or in the left or right pulmonary artery branches.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:creator rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199"/>
