        <oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>Protein S deficiency</oboInOwl:hasNarrowSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0004855</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Protein S functions as a cofactor to Protein C in the inactivation of Factors Va and VIIIa in the coagulation pathway. Therefore, a defect in protein S is associated with an increased risk of thrombosis.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Reduced protein S activity</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
