        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0005508</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>This is a characteristic feature of Waldenstrom macroglobulinemia (WM), which is defined as a B-cell lymphoplasmacytic lymphoma, characterized by monoclonal immunoglobulin M protein in the serum and infiltration of bone marrow with lymphoplasmacytic cells.</rdfs:comment>
