        <obo:IAO_0000115>Webbing or fusion of the fingers, involving soft parts only or including bone structure. Bony fusions are referred to as &quot;bony&quot; Syndactyly if the fusion occurs in a radio-ulnar axis. Fusions of bones of the fingers in a proximo-distal axis are referred to as &quot;Symphalangism&quot;.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>HP:0006057</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>SNOMEDCT_US:249769001</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
