        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0009908</oboInOwl:id>
        <oboInOwl:inSubset rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/hp#hposlim_core"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Shallow grooves or indentations are quite common, especially in large lobes. Ear lobe creases may arise postnatally. Posterior helical pits can be a related finding but should be assessed and coded separately.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Anterior creases of earlobe</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
