        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0010543</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>Spontaneous, non-rhythmic, multi-directional, chaotic movements of the eyes, giving the appearance of agitation. There may be bursts of conjugate movement of the eyes in varying directions and of varying amplitude.</rdfs:comment>
