        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Abnormal oestrogen level</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Clinical estrogen tests measure one of three components: estrone (E1), estradiol (E2), or estriol (E3).</rdfs:comment>
