        <obo:IAO_0000115>A posterolateral defect in the diaphragm, commonly referred to as a Bochdalek hernia, which is often accompanied by herniation of the stomach, intestines, liver, and/or spleen into the chest cavity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <terms:creator rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199"/>
