        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased C-reactive protein concentration</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased C-reactive protein level</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased C-reactive protein level in blood</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
