        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased complement factor H-related protein 1 concentration</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased complement factor H-related protein 1 level</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased complement factor H-related protein 1 level in blood</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Reduced complement factor H-related protein 1 concentration</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Reduced complement factor H-related protein 1 level</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
