        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased alpha-2-HS-glycoprotein concentration</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased alpha-2-HS-glycoprotein level</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased alpha-2-HS-glycoprotein level in blood</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased circulating fetuin-A concentration</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Reduced alpha-2-HS-glycoprotein concentration</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
