        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased thyroxine-binding globulin level</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Decreased thyroxine-binding globulin level in blood</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Reduced thyroxin-binding globulin</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
