        <oboInOwl:id>HP:0100806</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:comment>For clinical operationalization, organ dysfunction can be represented by an increase in the Sequential Sepsis-related Organ Failure Assessment (SOFA) score of 2 points or more.</rdfs:comment>
