        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Increased level of L-glutamic acid in blood</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Under normal circumstances, plasma glutamate concentration is 5-100 microM/L, the whole blood concentration is 150-300 microM/L while in the brain&apos;s ECF it is only 0.3-2 microM/L.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Hyperglutamatemia</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
